<title>USA: Brenton Banks sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Brenton Banks sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brenton Banks Inc said Wednesday it declared a 10 percent common stock dividend to be distributed on October 29 to shareholders of record on October 17.</p>
<p>Each shareholder will receive an additional share of Brenton Banks common stock for each 10 shares owned. Fractional shares will be paid in cash, the company said.</p>
<p>Brenton Banks said it set a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.13 a share, the same as last quarter, also payable on October 29 to shareholders of record on October 17.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
